 "notes": [
  "R-M9-52: minimized from the fortieth M9.6 Nightly's m9-gen7doublesou-s156-010. Last turn: Skuntank, frozen, cannot move (`cant|frz`); Burmy's Hidden Power (Fire by its IVs) thaws it (`-curestatus|frz|[msg]` after the hit). Hidden Power is Normal in the dex, so the replay took the thaw for Skuntank's own and gave it a second action. A thaw that does not start the cured Pok\u00e9mon's own action (its `move` or `cant` next) is the hit's (`own_action_follows`)."
